WEBVTT

31:06.641 --> 31:09.102
- This is fine work.
- It's not for sale.

31:09.227 --> 31:11.146
Boy, this is the King's Hand!

31:11.271 --> 31:14.649
- If his lordship wants the helmet...
- I made it for me.

31:14.774 --> 31:18.445
- Forgive him, my lord.
- There's nothing to forgive.

31:18.570 --> 31:22.073
When Lord Arryn came to visit you,
what would you talk about?

31:22.198 --> 31:24.075
He just asked me
questions is all, my lord.

31:24.200 --> 31:26.202
What kind of questions?

31:28.413 --> 31:31.291
About my work at first,
